msgstr "Valgt AT-port"

msgid "For Quectel EC200A use /dev/ttyUSB2. /dev/ttyUSB0 is the diagnostic port and does not answer AT commands."
msgstr "Til Quectel EC200A skal du bruge /dev/ttyUSB2. /dev/ttyUSB0 er diagnosticeringsporten og besvarer ikke AT-kommandoer."

